{"seq":3,"slug":"element-grounding","title":"元素定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-use-gui-agents/perception/element-grounding","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"元素定位\">元素定位</h1><p>「点击那个蓝色的提交按钮」——人一眼就知道点哪，模型却要跨过一道鸿沟：把这句自然语言，映射成屏幕上一个确切的像素坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这一步叫定位（grounding），是整条计算机使用流水线里最敏感、也是过去两年进步最集中的环节。前两篇（<a href=\"screen-understanding\">屏幕理解</a> 与 <a href=\"accessibility-tree\">无障碍树与 DOM</a>）已经把屏幕变成了「像素 + 结构」两份原料，定位负责在这两份原料上回答唯一的问题：我想操作的东西，坐标是多少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从指称到坐标\">核心概念：从指称到坐标</h2><p>定位可以形式化成一个映射：给定指令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 和屏幕观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>，输出目标元素的坐标或包围盒。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ground</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>或</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>bbox</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ground}(q, o) \\rightarrow (x, y) \\quad \\text{或} \\quad \\text{bbox} = (x_1, y_1, x_2, y_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ground</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bbox</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它之所以是瓶颈，源于 <a href=\"../foundations/gui-agent-challenges\">GUI 智能体挑战</a> 里那个「超大且连续的动作空间」：一块屏幕有两百万个可点位置，差几个像素就点到隔壁元素。定位错了，后面动作再对也是南辕北辙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[指令: 点击提交按钮] --&gt; B{有可靠结构?}&#10;  B --&gt;|有 DOM/A11Y| C[结构定位&lt;br/&gt;选中匹配节点 → 名义坐标]&#10;  B --&gt;|无或不全| D[视觉定位&lt;br/&gt;模型直接回归坐标]&#10;  C --&gt; E[像素校准&lt;br/&gt;核对渲染位置]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[最终点击坐标 x,y]&#10;  F --&gt; G[误差? 点空/点错]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[反馈重定位]\">flowchart TD\n  A[指令: 点击提交按钮] --&gt; B{有可靠结构?}\n  B --&gt;|有 DOM/A11Y| C[结构定位&lt;br/&gt;选中匹配节点 → 名义坐标]\n  B --&gt;|无或不全| D[视觉定位&lt;br/&gt;模型直接回归坐标]\n  C --&gt; E[像素校准&lt;br/&gt;核对渲染位置]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[最终点击坐标 x,y]\n  F --&gt; G[误差? 点空/点错]\n  G --&gt;|是| H[反馈重定位]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定位路线</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>短板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构定位</td>\n<td>从 DOM/A11Y 选节点取坐标</td>\n<td>精确、可解释</td>\n<td>依赖结构完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视觉定位（回归）</td>\n<td>VLM 直接输出坐标</td>\n<td>无结构也能用</td>\n<td>高分屏易偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Set-of-Marks</td>\n<td>选编号而非坐标</td>\n<td>降维成分类</td>\n<td>依赖检测不漏框</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合双定位</td>\n<td>结构主 + 像素校准</td>\n<td>稳、准</td>\n<td>工程复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视觉定位-让模型直接吐坐标\">视觉定位：让模型直接吐坐标</h2><p>最通用的做法是训练一个模型，输入截图和指令，直接输出坐标——把定位能力内化进权重。UGround、OS-Atlas、Aria-UI、GUI-Actor 这一批「GUI 定位基座模型」都属此列，对应 <a href=\"../foundations/computer-use-paradigms\">范式谱系</a> 里的「端到端原生」路线。它们的价值是：即便对面完全没有可读结构（Canvas、游戏、远程桌面），只要能截图就能定位。</p>\n<p>衡量视觉定位的标准基准是 ScreenSpot 系列。基础版 ScreenSpot-v2 到 2026 年已被 GUI-CURSOR 做到 93.9%，看似接近饱和；但一换到专治高分辨率专业软件的 ScreenSpot-Pro，同一模型骤降到 56.5%（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.00008\">DiMo-GUI</a>）。2025 年的 7B 模型在 ScreenSpot-Pro 上更是普遍低于 20%——OS-Atlas-7B 18.9%、UGround-7B 16.5%（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2504.07981v1\">ScreenSpot-Pro 论文</a>）。这条落差说明：普通界面的定位基本被攻克，密集小目标的专业界面仍是硬骨头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构定位与坐标系校准\">结构定位与坐标系校准</h2><p>当结构可信时，定位可以走一条精确得多的路：在 DOM/A11Y 树里按名称、角色、位置匹配出目标节点，直接读它的包围盒中心作为点击点。这条路不受高分辨率之苦，也天然可解释——你能说清「我点的是 id 为 submit 的 button」。</p>\n<p>但结构定位有个必须处理的暗坑：坐标系换算。模型看到的截图往往被缩放过（比如长边压到 1000），它输出的坐标在「模型坐标系」里；真实屏幕可能是 2560×1440，还带着设备像素比（Retina 屏 DPR=2）。三者之间任何一个缩放比搞错，点击就整体偏移。稳健的实现会显式记录 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\frac{W_{\\text{real}}}{W_{\\text{model}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3451em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 并对每个输出坐标做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{\\text{real}} = s \\cdot x_{\\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的还原。这个不起眼的换算是实践中最常见的「模型明明看对了却点空」的元凶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"融合两条腿-混合定位\">融合两条腿：混合定位</h2><p>2026 年最强的系统几乎都做混合定位（对应范式谱系里的混合派）。典型策略：以结构定位为主干拿到候选元素和名义坐标，再用视觉核对——截图上那个位置真的是目标吗？是否被弹窗遮挡、是否已滚出视口？OSCAR 的 dual-grounding 就是先用 A11Y 树建组件表示，再叠加视觉语义标注做交叉验证。</p>\n<p>混合的另一个动机是互相兜底：结构缺失时退回纯视觉定位，视觉不确定时用结构约束候选集。这种冗余把单点失败变成「两条腿至少站住一条」，直接抬升了长任务的单步成功率——而单步成功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 连乘决定整体成败（见 <a href=\"../foundations/gui-agent-challenges\">GUI 智能体挑战</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定位之后-交给动作\">定位之后：交给动作</h2><p>定位输出一个坐标，故事并没结束——这个坐标要被包进一个具体动作（左键单击？双击？还是右键？）才能执行，而动作的表示方式（用绝对坐标还是元素 id）反过来又约束了定位该输出什么。这正是感知章与动作章的接缝：定位的输出格式，必须匹配 <a href=\"../action/action-space\">动作空间 (点击/输入)</a> 的输入格式。若动作空间以「元素 id」为参数，定位就该输出 id 而非像素；若以绝对坐标为参数，定位就必须扛下坐标系校准的全部责任。</p>\n<p>因此定位不是孤立的一步，而是被下游动作空间设计反向塑形的。选择哪条定位路线，往往取决于你的动作层想要什么样的参数——这也是为什么这两篇要连着读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>定位（grounding）把「指称」映射成屏幕坐标，是流水线最敏感的瓶颈，源于连续两百万点的超大动作空间。</li>\n<li>三条路线：视觉定位（模型直接回归坐标，最通用）、结构定位（读 DOM/A11Y 节点，最精确）、Set-of-Marks（选编号，降维成分类）。</li>\n<li>ScreenSpot-v2 已近饱和（93.9%），但高分辨率专业软件的 ScreenSpot-Pro 仍只有 ~56.5%——密集小目标是当前硬骨头。</li>\n<li>坐标系与设备像素比的换算是「看对却点空」的常见元凶；2026 主流是混合定位，以结构为主、视觉校准，互相兜底抬升单步成功率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>两份输入原料：<a href=\"screen-understanding\">屏幕理解</a>（像素）与 <a href=\"accessibility-tree\">无障碍树与 DOM</a>（结构）。</li>\n<li>本篇输出的去向：<a href=\"../action/action-space\">动作空间 (点击/输入)</a>——坐标如何被包进可执行动作，且动作参数如何反向约束定位。</li>\n<li>为何是瓶颈：<a href=\"../foundations/gui-agent-challenges\">GUI 智能体挑战</a>——超大动作空间与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 连乘。</li>\n<li>跨库（VLM）：<a href=\"../../vision-language-models/architecture/visual-tokenization\">视觉分词</a>——视觉定位精度为何受制于分词粒度。</li>\n<li>跨库（评测）：<a href=\"../../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/multimodal-benchmarks\">多模态基准</a>——ScreenSpot 这类定位基准在多模态评测版图中的位置。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"元素定位","id":"元素定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从指称到坐标","id":"核心概念-从指称到坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉定位：让模型直接吐坐标","id":"视觉定位-让模型直接吐坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"结构定位与坐标系校准","id":"结构定位与坐标系校准"},{"level":2,"text":"融合两条腿：混合定位","id":"融合两条腿-混合定位"},{"level":2,"text":"定位之后：交给动作","id":"定位之后-交给动作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"无障碍树与 DOM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-use-gui-agents/perception/accessibility-tree"},"next":{"title":"动作空间 (点击/输入)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-use-gui-agents/action/action-space"}}